# Constraints gate

`CONSTRAINTS.md` at the repo root is the quality bar: the floor plus the
enforced, numbered dimensions (coverage ≥ 95% project and patch via Codecov,
zero type errors, zero failing tests). Read it before writing code. Do not
weaken it — or `codecov.yml`, `bunfig.toml`, or this file — to make a change
pass. A coverage number moving down, a suppression comment appearing, or a
threshold changing in the same commit as a failing feature is a review finding.
